      {
        "h_title": "Nam Prik Noom (Thai Green Chilli Sauce)",
        "main_title": "Nam Prik Noom (Thai Green Chilli Paste)",
        "author": null,
        "language": "en",
        "level": 2,
        "primary_content": [
          {
            "text": "Let's make one of Thailand's much loved but lesser known Nam Priks (chilli condiment), Nam Prik Noom (Thai Green Chilli Sauce).",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          }
        ],
        "secondary_content": null,
        "table_content": null
      },
      {
        "h_title": "Ingredients",
        "main_title": "Nam Prik Noom (Thai Green Chilli Paste)",
        "author": null,
        "language": "en",
        "level": 3,
        "primary_content": [
          {
            "text": "▢ 3 medium heat or mild large green chillies",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "▢ 3 Thai green chillies",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "▢ 2 medium onions",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "▢ 1 medium aubergine (eggplant)",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "▢ 1 large tomato",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "▢ 2 Tbsp lime juice",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          }
        ],
        "secondary_content": [
          {
            "text": "▢ 10 cloves garlic",
            "url": "https://www.target.com/p/spice-world-fresh-whole-garlic-3ct-bag/-/A-14917318?aflt=plt",
            "urls": [
              {
                "url": "https://www.target.com/p/spice-world-fresh-whole-garlic-3ct-bag/-/A-14917318?aflt=plt",
                "anchor_text": "garlic"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "▢ 1 tsp palm sugar",
            "url": "https://www.linsfood.com/palm-sugar/",
            "urls": [
              {
                "url": "https://www.linsfood.com/palm-sugar/",
                "anchor_text": "palm sugar"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "▢ 2 Tbsp fish sauce",
            "url": "https://www.target.com/p/thai-kitchen-premium-fish-sauce-6-76-fl-oz/-/A-47090977?aflt=plt",
            "urls": [
              {
                "url": "https://www.target.com/p/thai-kitchen-premium-fish-sauce-6-76-fl-oz/-/A-47090977?aflt=plt",
                "anchor_text": "fish sauce"
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "table_content": null
      },
      {
        "h_title": "Instructions",
        "main_title": "Nam Prik Noom (Thai Green Chilli Paste)",
        "author": null,
        "language": "en",
        "level": 3,
        "primary_content": [
          {
            "text": "Place the aubergine on a low open flame on the gas stove for 10 minutes, turning it around a couple of times.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "Get all the other ingredients ready in the meantime. Top the onions & garlic as mentioned above, that is, slice the non pointy ends off.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "When the aubergine has had its time, place everything under a medium grill (halfway) for about 10 minutes, turning once. You'll find the little chillies going completely soft first, take them out if you prefer, but I like the \"overdone\" flavour, it's sweet.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "Place everything apart from the garnish into a chopper & chop away to your heart's content! I like to go for a fine, liquid-y grind.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "Serve as a dip or a topping for canapés as in picture. I also like to add a tablespoon or so to curries and other Asian stews for a wonderful, tangy depth.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "Store in a sterilised jar for about 2 weeks in the fridge.",
            "url": "https://www.linsfood.com/sterilizing/",
            "urls": [
              {
                "url": "https://www.linsfood.com/sterilizing/",
                "anchor_text": "sterilised"
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "secondary_content": null,
        "table_content": null
      }
    ],
